<task id="013" project="field-mapping-server-write-path-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Unified RecordCreationService Create mode: principals, 12-step pipeline, typed refusals + HTTP map (FR-06, FR-07, FR-12)</title>
    <phase>2 W2 Unified RecordCreationService</phase>
    <gate>011+012 complete</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies .cs in Sprk.Bff.Api; tags include bff-api, security; adds tests at KEEP paths (TEST-MODIFYING override); FR-06/FR-07 are named security-sensitive in NFR-01.</rigor-reason>
